      "text": "7:20 PM ET\nChillers fail,\nuse1-az4\n\n7:48 PM\nTrading halts\n\n9:29 PM\nAWS terminates\nthe instances.\n3 of 5 nodes\ngone. Quorum\nlost.\n\n+ MSK control\nplane stuck,\ncan't re-elect\npartition leaders",
