      "text": "THE MANUAL FIX\n\nEmergency code\nchange mid-\nincident: drop the\n\"all 5 nodes must\nresolve\" startup\nassumption\n\nNew node group\nstood up outside\nthe dead\nplacement group\n\nQuorum rebuilt\nby hand",
